'''''Omniscient Inquiry of Arcana''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Enter the Divination Commission
# Follow Qingque to the Divination Commission's side entrance
# Unlock the side entrance with Qingque's hints
# Go with Qingque to meet Fu Xuan
# Speak with Fu Xuan
# Restart the Temporal Terminal
# Restart the Spatial Terminal
# Restart the Karma Terminal
# Help the Divination Commission to restart the Matrix of Prescience's three base terminals
# Return to the Matrix core and report to Fu Xuan

